{%- comment -%}
  A piece's price, with the old one struck through when it is on sale (a compare-at price above
  the price). Used by the card, the product page and Quick view, so a sale reads the same everywhere.
  Params: p.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if p.compare_at_price > p.price -%}<s class="was"><span class="vh">{{ 'products.product.was' | t }} </span>{{ p.compare_at_price | money }}</s> {% endif -%}
{{- p.price | money -}}
